p;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#openai-details-clay-s-customer-18e073" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#marcora-brings-brand-reference-answers-937fa4" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Marcora上架Google Chat，把品牌參考庫帶進行銷與銷售對話</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Marcora宣布Google Chat行銷代理上架，團隊可在工作對話中查詢品牌定位與競爭資料，並草擬內容。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">已批准品牌背景進入工作對話後，產品行銷可決定哪些角色與行業說法可組合成銷售話術，並核對生成稿是否沿用正確依據。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#marcora-brings-brand-reference-answers-937fa4" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">03 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#transcosmos-launches-trans-voice-connect-c03ee2" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">transcosmos推出trans-AI Voice，把門店對話接到顧客資料與行銷跟進</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">transcosmos公布trans-AI Voice，結合對話記錄、AI洞察及顧客資料平台，把線下互動帶進銷售與行銷流程。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">線下顧慮可與交易資料對照後，零售及B2B團隊可決定哪些產品說明或跟進訊息需要修訂，而非只依賴前線印象。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#transcosmos-launches-trans-voice-connect-c03ee2" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">04 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#stensul-checks-whether-email-offers-bfb94d" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Stensul檢查電郵優惠是否易被AI讀取，摘要預覽仍待推出</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">優惠可讀性加入寄送前檢查後，電郵團隊可決定哪些圖片優惠須補成文字，以及哪些促銷資料需要逐封更新。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#stensul-checks-whether-email-offers-bfb94d" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#9A3A9E">05 / 行業影響 &amp; 品牌案例 · 可即用</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#myavana-s-black-friday-campaign-d9459d" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">MYAVANA黑五活動先做AI髮質分析，再導向個人化產品選購</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">AI分析放在優惠之前，美容行銷團隊可決定導購入口先問哪些髮質需要，再把適合的商品與零售連結呈現給用戶。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-5#myavana-s-black-friday-campaign-d9459d" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">06 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 要留意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#pine-labs-rolls-out-merchant-15905e" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Pine Labs在印度推出商戶AI代理，Google廣告支出前須先批准</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">營業資料與廣告設定放進商戶應用程式後，小型零售團隊可先把具體門店目標轉成活動，再決定是否批准支出。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#pine-labs-rolls-out-merchant-15905e" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:23px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="background:#EBE8FF"><tr><td style="border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TEAM ACTION BOARD</div><div style="font:800 18px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding:7px 0 12px">今日可以跟進嘅方向</div><table role="presentation"><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">01</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">選一組潛客，把公開研究、資格判斷及銷售簡報分開列成任務，比較各步資料依據與成本，再決定模型分工。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">02</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">選一個買家角色及行業，要求代理組合話術，逐句對照定位、產品與競爭參考，再把已確認版本存回團隊文件。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">03</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">選一類獲准記錄的門店諮詢，人工核對AI摘要中的購買顧慮，再與CRM記錄配對，測試一項針對性的跟進訊息。</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 25px"><table role="presentation"><tr><td bgcolor="#5A42F4" style="background:#5A42F4;border-radius:24px;padding:13px 25px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=cta" style="font:800 14px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;text-decoration:none">閱讀今日完整新聞 &#8594;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#151841" style="background:#151841;padding:24px"><div style="font:800 16px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI Marketing Daily</div><div style="font:12px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#E5E2EF;padding-top:8px">Curated by Carrie Hui · AI Marketing Intelligence</div><div style="font:11px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#B9BADA;padding-top:9px">本電郵為已發佈網站內容精選，原始來源請查閱網站。</div><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-11-26&amp;utm_content=footer" style="font:12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">在瀏覽器閱讀</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>]]></description></item><